<title>USA: Robinson Nugent CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Robinson Nugent CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ALBANY, Ind. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robinson Nugent Inc said Friday that Anthony Accurso had resigned as vice president, treasurer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Accurso accepted a position as vice president and chief financial officer at White-Rodgers, a division of Emerson Electric Co in St. Louis, it said.</p>
<p>Robinson Nugent, which makes and markets electronic connectors, integrated circuit sockets and cable assemblies, said it had named Robert Knabel, who is worldwide corporate controller, as acting chief financial officer.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
